### 
Nested Subproofs:
    A test for nested subproofs (depth two)

Dependencies: AND_INTRO
###

GIVEN A 
GIVEN B
DERIVE A AND B

ASSUME C                      # push(C)

    APPLY AND_INTRO A, C      # yield A && C

    ASSUME D                  # push(D)
        APPLY AND_INTRO C, D  # yield C && D
    END                       # pop(D)

END                           # pop(C)

APPLY AND_INTRO A, B          # yield A && B

CONCLUDE